msgid "Our story"
msgstr "Hekayəmiz"

#: templates/about.html:8
msgid "Ethical dentistry in Istanbul — only what you need"
msgstr "İstanbulda etik stomatologiya — yalnız sizə lazım olan"

#: templates/about.html:9
msgid ""
"We believe the most important skill in dentistry is knowing when not to "
"treat. Every plan starts with saving your natural teeth, a transparent "
